1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,788
Raat ho chuki hai, hospital ka discharge counter.

2
00:00:02,788 --> 00:00:05,228
Papa ki surgery theek se ho gayi,

3
00:00:05,228 --> 00:00:07,319
sab ke chehre par sukoon hai.

4
00:00:07,319 --> 00:00:09,759
Bhai file lekar counter par khada hai.

5
00:00:09,759 --> 00:00:13,593
Billing wale bhaiya screen dekhte hain, aur dheere se kehte hain,

6
00:00:13,593 --> 00:00:16,730
insurance ne claim ka bada hissa kaat diya hai.

7
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:19,403
Bhai ko samajh nahi aata. Policy toh thi,

8
00:00:19,403 --> 00:00:23,078
premium har saal time par bhara. Phir yeh kat kaise gaya?

9
00:00:23,078 --> 00:00:25,083
Mummy ki aankhon mein chinta hai.

10
00:00:25,083 --> 00:00:28,090
Wife phone par account ka balance dekh rahi hai.

11
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:30,429
Jo paisa SIP ke liye rakha tha,

12
00:00:30,429 --> 00:00:32,100
ab wahi hospital ko jayega.

13
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,857
Yeh kahani sirf is ghar ki nahi hai.

14
00:00:34,857 --> 00:00:38,647
Bahut saare insured parivaar discharge ke waqt yahi jhatka khaate hain.

15
00:00:38,647 --> 00:00:40,714
Wajah aksar koi dhokha nahi hota.

16
00:00:40,714 --> 00:00:43,126
Wajah hoti hai policy ka chhota print,

17
00:00:43,126 --> 00:00:45,193
jo humne kabhi padha hi nahi.

18
00:00:45,193 --> 00:00:47,950
Aur woh print bilkul saaf likha hota hai.

19
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:52,440
Toh aaj is chhote print ko line by line khol kar padhte hain.

20
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,130
Pehla sawaal,

21
00:00:53,130 --> 00:00:56,929
kya room rent ki limit se poora claim kat sakta hai?

22
00:00:56,929 --> 00:01:00,728
Doosra sawaal, waiting period mein kya nahi milta? Aur aakhri sawaal,

23
00:01:00,728 --> 00:01:02,800
kya office ka insurance kaafi hai?

24
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:05,301
Chaliye kahani ko peeche le chalte hain.

25
00:01:05,301 --> 00:01:07,445
Papa ko seene mein dard hua,

26
00:01:07,445 --> 00:01:10,661
raat ko emergency mein le gaye. Doctor ne kaha,

27
00:01:10,661 --> 00:01:13,877
admit karna padega, surgery hogi. Reception par sawaal aaya,

28
00:01:13,877 --> 00:01:17,450
kaunsa kamra chahiye? General ward, shared room, ya private room?

29
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:21,412
Bhai ne ek second nahi socha. Usne kaha, private room do,

30
00:01:21,412 --> 00:01:25,015
Papa ko aaram chahiye. Logic seedha tha. Insurance hai na,

31
00:01:25,015 --> 00:01:28,977
bill toh company bharegi. Papa ki sehat par kanjoosi kyun karein?

32
00:01:28,977 --> 00:01:31,859
Us waqt yeh faisla pyaar jaisa lagta hai,

33
00:01:31,859 --> 00:01:33,300
galti jaisa bilkul nahi.

34
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:37,309
Ab policy ka woh page dekhiye jo kisi ne nahi padha.

35
00:01:37,309 --> 00:01:39,496
Usme likha tha room rent limit.

36
00:01:39,496 --> 00:01:44,234
Room rent limit yaani company ek din ke kamre ka jitna kiraya maanegi,

37
00:01:44,234 --> 00:01:48,243
bas utna hi. Usse mehenga kamra liya, toh fark aap bharoge.

38
00:01:48,243 --> 00:01:50,430
Yahan tak baat samajh aati hai.

39
00:01:50,430 --> 00:01:54,041
Asli jhatka agla hai, jise kehte hain proportionate deduction.

40
00:01:54,041 --> 00:01:56,850
Proportionate deduction yaani kamra jitne guna mehenga,

41
00:01:56,850 --> 00:02:00,862
baaki bill bhi usi hisaab se katega. Sirf kiraya nahi,

42
00:02:00,862 --> 00:02:04,071
doctor ki fees, nursing, operation theatre ke charges,

43
00:02:04,071 --> 00:02:06,880
sab usi anupaat mein kat jaate hain.

44
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:11,571
Kyunki hospital mehenge kamre ke saath har service ka rate bhi badha deta hai.

45
00:02:11,571 --> 00:02:14,587
Bade kamre ka patient, bada package. Company kehti hai,

46
00:02:14,587 --> 00:02:16,933
humne chhote kamre ka wada kiya tha.

47
00:02:16,933 --> 00:02:20,284
Toh hum har cheez chhote kamre ke rate se denge.

48
00:02:20,284 --> 00:02:23,970
Isi liye ek kamre ke faisle ne poora bill kha liya.

49
00:02:23,970 --> 00:02:27,609
Phir aaya doosra jhatka, consumables. Consumables yaani gloves, mask, syringe,

50
00:02:27,609 --> 00:02:28,700
cotton jaisi cheezein,

51
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:31,975
jo ek baar use hokar fenk di jaati hain.

52
00:02:31,975 --> 00:02:34,522
Kai policies inhe cover hi nahi karti.

53
00:02:34,522 --> 00:02:37,069
Bill mein inki lambi list hoti hai,

54
00:02:37,069 --> 00:02:39,980
aur har line aapki jeb se jaati hai.

55
00:02:39,980 --> 00:02:41,031
Teesra jhatka, sub-limit.

56
00:02:41,031 --> 00:02:46,284
Sub-limit yaani kuch khaas ilaaj par company ne alag se ek chhat bana di hai.

57
00:02:46,284 --> 00:02:49,086
Jaise motiyabind ka operation, ya ghutne ki surgery.

58
00:02:49,086 --> 00:02:51,537
Aapka total cover bada ho sakta hai,

59
00:02:51,537 --> 00:02:55,390
par us ilaaj ke liye sirf chhat tak hi paisa milega.

60
00:02:55,390 --> 00:02:56,383
Aur chautha, co-pay.

61
00:02:56,383 --> 00:03:00,025
Co-pay yaani har claim mein ek tay hissa aap khud bharoge,

62
00:03:00,025 --> 00:03:01,680
chahe bill kitna bhi ho.

63
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:04,990
Kai policies mein yeh senior citizens ke liye hota hai.

64
00:03:04,990 --> 00:03:08,301
Premium thoda kam dikhta hai, isliye log khush hote hain.

65
00:03:08,301 --> 00:03:11,280
Par bill ke din yahi hissa bhaari padta hai.

66
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:13,404
Toh pehle sawaal ka jawab, haan.

67
00:03:13,404 --> 00:03:16,944
Ek room rent limit poore claim ko kaat sakti hai.

68
00:03:16,944 --> 00:03:19,068
Isliye admit karte waqt hi poochiye,

69
00:03:19,068 --> 00:03:21,546
meri policy kaunsa kamra allow karti hai?

70
00:03:21,546 --> 00:03:24,732
Kai policies mein room rent limit hoti hi nahi.

71
00:03:24,732 --> 00:03:27,210
Apni policy check kijiye, andaza mat lagaiye.

72
00:03:27,210 --> 00:03:28,786
Ab doosra ghar, doosri kahani.

73
00:03:28,786 --> 00:03:32,252
Behen ne pichhle saal Mummy ke liye nayi health policy li.

74
00:03:32,252 --> 00:03:34,457
Mummy ko sugar hai, BP bhi hai.

75
00:03:34,457 --> 00:03:37,293
Form bharte waqt agent ne kaha, chhoti cheezein hain,

76
00:03:37,293 --> 00:03:40,760
likhne ki kya zaroorat. Behen ne socha, form jaldi bhar jayega,

77
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:42,020
premium bhi kam aayega.

78
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:46,120
Kuch mahine baad Mummy ko hospital jaana pada. Claim gaya,

79
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:49,810
aur wapas aaya ek chitthi ke saath. Claim reject.

80
00:03:49,810 --> 00:03:54,320
Wajah likhi thi, pre-existing disease ka waiting period, aur jaankari chhupana.

81
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:58,830
Behen hairaan thi. Policy toh active thi, premium bhi bhara tha.

82
00:03:58,830 --> 00:04:01,838
Pehle term samajhiye. Pre-existing disease yaani woh bimari,

83
00:04:01,838 --> 00:04:05,975
jo policy lene se pehle hi aapko thi. Jaise sugar, BP,

84
00:04:05,975 --> 00:04:08,607
thyroid, ya dil ki koi purani takleef.

85
00:04:08,607 --> 00:04:11,992
Company in bimariyon ka kharcha shuru se nahi uthaati.

86
00:04:11,992 --> 00:04:15,000
Inke liye ek intezaar ka samay hota hai.

87
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,601
Isi intezaar ko kehte hain waiting period.

88
00:04:17,601 --> 00:04:21,316
Waiting period yaani policy lene ke baad ka woh samay,

89
00:04:21,316 --> 00:04:25,403
jisme kuch claims nahi milte. Ek shuruaati waiting period hota hai,

90
00:04:25,403 --> 00:04:28,375
jab accident chhod kar lagbhag kuch nahi milta.

91
00:04:28,375 --> 00:04:32,090
Phir kuch khaas bimariyon ka alag waiting period hota hai.

92
00:04:32,090 --> 00:04:35,461
Aur sabse lamba hota hai purani bimariyon ka waiting period.

93
00:04:35,461 --> 00:04:40,518
Achhi baat yeh hai ki IRDAI ne iski upar ki seema kam kar di hai.

94
00:04:40,518 --> 00:04:44,226
IRDAI yaani insurance companies ka regulator, jo unke niyam banata hai.

95
00:04:44,226 --> 00:04:47,260
Phir bhi har policy ka apna samay hota hai,

96
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:49,620
jo uske kaagazon mein likha hota hai.

97
00:04:49,620 --> 00:04:51,160
Ab Behen wali galti dekhiye.

98
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:53,933
Mummy ki bimari form mein chhupa di gayi thi.

99
00:04:53,933 --> 00:04:57,013
Toh waiting period ke baad bhi company keh sakti thi,

100
00:04:57,013 --> 00:04:58,245
aapne sach nahi bataya.

101
00:04:58,245 --> 00:05:01,018
Non-disclosure yaani form mein koi zaroori baat na batana.

102
00:05:01,018 --> 00:05:03,790
Yeh claim reject hone ki sabse aam wajah hai.

103
00:05:03,790 --> 00:05:08,154
Agent ki salah us waqt aasaan lagti hai. Premium kam,

104
00:05:08,154 --> 00:05:12,082
form chhota, koi medical test nahi. Par yaad rakhiye,

105
00:05:12,082 --> 00:05:16,446
claim ke waqt agent nahi, company aapki file padhti hai.

106
00:05:16,446 --> 00:05:19,938
Aur company sabse pehle wahi form kholti hai,

107
00:05:19,938 --> 00:05:22,120
jo aapne sign kiya tha.

108
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:25,142
Ab ek bada niyam, jise moratorium kehte hain.

109
00:05:25,142 --> 00:05:27,408
Moratorium yaani ek suraksha ki deewar.

110
00:05:27,408 --> 00:05:30,052
Lagaataar 60 mahine policy chalne ke baad,

111
00:05:30,052 --> 00:05:34,206
company non-disclosure ke naam par claim par sawaal nahi utha sakti.

112
00:05:34,206 --> 00:05:36,850
Sirf saabit dhokhe ka case alag hai.

113
00:05:36,850 --> 00:05:39,881
Is niyam mein ek shabd bahut zaroori hai, lagaataar.

114
00:05:39,881 --> 00:05:42,913
Agar beech mein policy toot gayi, renew nahi hui,

115
00:05:42,913 --> 00:05:45,271
toh ginti shuru se ho sakti hai.

116
00:05:45,271 --> 00:05:48,976
Isliye renewal ki date kabhi miss mat kijiye. Auto debit lagaiye,

117
00:05:48,976 --> 00:05:50,660
ya calendar mein reminder rakhiye.

118
00:05:50,660 --> 00:05:52,592
Toh doosre sawaal ka jawab.

119
00:05:52,592 --> 00:05:57,614
Waiting period mein purani bimari aur kuch khaas ilaaj ka claim nahi milta.

120
00:05:57,614 --> 00:05:58,773
Aur sach chhupaya,

121
00:05:58,773 --> 00:06:02,250
toh waiting ke baad bhi claim atak sakta hai.

122
00:06:02,250 --> 00:06:04,568
Isliye form mein har bimari likhiye.

123
00:06:04,568 --> 00:06:08,045
60 mahine ki deewar bhi tabhi kaam aati hai,

124
00:06:08,045 --> 00:06:09,590
jab policy lagaataar chale.

125
00:06:09,590 --> 00:06:12,836
Teesri kahani, ek office wali. Bhai ki naukri achhi hai,

126
00:06:12,836 --> 00:06:15,108
company ne group health insurance diya hai.

127
00:06:15,108 --> 00:06:20,301
Group insurance yaani company ki taraf se sab employees ke liye ek saath li gayi policy.

128
00:06:20,301 --> 00:06:23,222
Bhai kehta hai, mujhe alag policy ki kya zaroorat,

129
00:06:23,222 --> 00:06:24,520
office wala hai na.

130
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:27,162
Uska logic galat nahi lagta. Premium company bharti hai,

131
00:06:27,162 --> 00:06:28,923
pehle din se cover milta hai.

132
00:06:28,923 --> 00:06:31,565
Kai group policies mein waiting period bhi nahi hota.

133
00:06:31,565 --> 00:06:34,207
Kabhi parents bhi saath mein cover ho jaate hain.

134
00:06:34,207 --> 00:06:36,262
Bina kuch kiye sab mil raha hai,

135
00:06:36,262 --> 00:06:37,730
toh apna paisa kyun lagayein?

136
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:40,676
Phir ek din office se email aaya, restructuring.

137
00:06:40,676 --> 00:06:43,622
Bhai ki naukri chali gayi. Salary band hui,

138
00:06:43,622 --> 00:06:45,831
aur saath mein health insurance bhi.

139
00:06:45,831 --> 00:06:49,513
Group policy naukri ke saath judi hoti hai. Naukri gayi,

140
00:06:49,513 --> 00:06:52,091
toh cover bhi usi ke saath khatam.

141
00:06:52,091 --> 00:06:54,300
Aksar lamba notice bhi nahi milta.

142
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:57,636
Ab sochiye, usi mahine Papa ko phir hospital jaana pade.

143
00:06:57,636 --> 00:06:59,971
Na office ka cover, na apni policy.

144
00:06:59,971 --> 00:07:01,972
Aur ab nayi policy lene jaayein,

145
00:07:01,972 --> 00:07:05,975
toh Papa ki umar aur bimari dekh kar premium bahut zyada hoga.

146
00:07:05,975 --> 00:07:08,310
Upar se waiting period phir se shuru.

147
00:07:08,310 --> 00:07:10,532
Doosri dikkat, cover sab mein bat-ta hai.

148
00:07:10,532 --> 00:07:14,976
Office ki policy mein aksar ek hi cover poore parivaar ke liye hota hai.

149
00:07:14,976 --> 00:07:16,881
Papa ka bada operation ho gaya,

150
00:07:16,881 --> 00:07:20,055
toh saal ka cover wahin khatam. Phir Beti beemar padi,

151
00:07:20,055 --> 00:07:21,960
toh uske liye kuch nahi bacha.

152
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:25,662
Aur teesri dikkat, retirement. Jis din aap retire hote ho,

153
00:07:25,662 --> 00:07:28,624
office ka insurance bhi retire ho jaata hai.

154
00:07:28,624 --> 00:07:32,697
Aur bimari ka sabse zyada khatra usi umar mein hota hai.

155
00:07:32,697 --> 00:07:36,770
Us waqt nayi policy lena mehenga bhi hai, aur mushkil bhi.

156
00:07:36,770 --> 00:07:39,118
Toh teesre sawaal ka jawab, nahi.

157
00:07:39,118 --> 00:07:43,423
Office ka insurance ek achha bonus hai, par akela kaafi nahi.

158
00:07:43,423 --> 00:07:45,771
Apni ek alag policy honi chahiye,

159
00:07:45,771 --> 00:07:50,075
jo naukri badalne par bhi saath chale. Aur jitni jaldi lenge,

160
00:07:50,075 --> 00:07:54,380
utni jaldi waiting period aur 60 mahine ki ginti shuru hogi.

161
00:07:54,380 --> 00:07:56,788
Ab sabse badi galti ki baat.

162
00:07:56,788 --> 00:08:00,800
Hum policy khareedte waqt sirf premium aur cover dekhte hain.

163
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,806
Kitna bharna hai, kitna milega.

164
00:08:02,806 --> 00:08:05,615
Par claim kat-ta hai un cheezon se,

165
00:08:05,615 --> 00:08:09,627
jo beech mein likhi hoti hain. Room rent, sub-limit, co-pay,

166
00:08:09,627 --> 00:08:10,430
waiting period.

167
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:12,748
Pehla kaam, Customer Information Sheet padhiye.

168
00:08:12,748 --> 00:08:15,838
Customer Information Sheet yaani policy ka chhota saar,

169
00:08:15,838 --> 00:08:19,314
jisme saari zaroori shartein ek jagah likhi hoti hain.

170
00:08:19,314 --> 00:08:23,563
Har company ko yeh deni hoti hai. Isme room rent, co-pay,

171
00:08:23,563 --> 00:08:27,040
sub-limit aur har waiting period dekhiye. Pen lekar padhiye.

172
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:30,011
Doosra kaam, cashless aur reimbursement ka fark samjhiye.

173
00:08:30,011 --> 00:08:34,468
Cashless yaani bill seedha company aur hospital ke beech settle hota hai.

174
00:08:34,468 --> 00:08:38,553
Yeh network hospital mein hota hai. Network hospital yaani woh hospital,

175
00:08:38,553 --> 00:08:40,782
jiska company ke saath tie-up hai.

176
00:08:40,782 --> 00:08:43,010
Wahan pehle approval lena padta hai.

177
00:08:43,010 --> 00:08:46,461
Reimbursement yaani pehle aap apni jeb se bill bharo,

178
00:08:46,461 --> 00:08:50,680
phir kaagaz dekar company se paisa wapas maango. Isme original bills,

179
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:54,131
reports aur discharge summary sambhaal kar rakhni hoti hai.

180
00:08:54,131 --> 00:08:57,583
Ek kaagaz kho gaya, toh claim atak sakta hai.

181
00:08:57,583 --> 00:08:59,500
Isliye ek alag file banaiye.

182
00:08:59,500 --> 00:09:03,837
Achhi khabar yeh hai ki IRDAI ne cashless discharge ka time tight kar diya hai.

183
00:09:03,837 --> 00:09:06,728
Company ko discharge ki approval ghanton mein deni hoti hai,

184
00:09:06,728 --> 00:09:08,752
din bhar ka intezaar nahi. Der ho,

185
00:09:08,752 --> 00:09:10,775
toh insurance desk se likhit mein poochiye.

186
00:09:10,775 --> 00:09:12,510
Shikayat ka raasta bhi hota hai.

187
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:16,678
Teesra kaam, form mein sach likhiye. Har bimari, har dawai,

188
00:09:16,678 --> 00:09:20,013
har purani surgery. Premium thoda badh sakta hai,

189
00:09:20,013 --> 00:09:24,598
par claim ke din aapki file saaf rahegi. Aur chautha kaam,

190
00:09:24,598 --> 00:09:27,933
office policy ke alawa apni ek policy rakhiye,

191
00:09:27,933 --> 00:09:29,600
khaaskar parents ke liye.

192
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,812
Ek fayda aur hai.

193
00:09:30,812 --> 00:09:34,450
Old tax regime mein health insurance premium par tax deduction milta hai,

194
00:09:34,450 --> 00:09:37,480
apne aur parents ke liye. Toh premium sirf kharch nahi,

195
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,996
thoda tax bhi bachata hai.

196
00:09:38,996 --> 00:09:42,330
Apna hisaab apne CA ya tax advisor se zaroor check kijiye.

197
00:09:42,330 --> 00:09:43,299
Aur yaad rakhiye,

198
00:09:43,299 --> 00:09:48,143
health insurance ka asli kaam hai bimari ke din aapki SIP aur savings ko bachana.

199
00:09:48,143 --> 00:09:50,727
Claim kat gaya, toh log udhaar lete hain,

200
00:09:50,727 --> 00:09:53,310
ya SIP rok dete hain. Policy sahi ho,

201
00:09:53,310 --> 00:09:56,540
toh yeh nahi karna padta. Yeh investment advice nahi hai.

202
00:09:56,540 --> 00:09:58,606
Ab aapse ek seedha sawaal.

203
00:09:58,606 --> 00:10:02,739
Aapki health policy mein room rent limit hai ya nahi?

204
00:10:02,739 --> 00:10:06,458
Bina dekhe jawab mat dena. Policy kholiye, check kijiye,

205
00:10:06,458 --> 00:10:10,590
aur comments mein sirf likhiye, haan, nahi, ya pata nahi.

206
00:10:10,590 --> 00:10:11,830
Main sab padhunga.

207
00:10:11,830 --> 00:10:16,146
Agle video mein baat karenge term insurance ki. Kitna cover chahiye,

208
00:10:16,146 --> 00:10:19,285
aur log galat policy kyun khareed lete hain.

209
00:10:19,285 --> 00:10:22,425
Tab tak yeh video us insaan ko bhejiye,

210
00:10:22,425 --> 00:10:25,171
jiske paas sirf office ka insurance hai.

